  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ayla Oasis Regeneration Project Aqaba II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of a long-term senior secured loan of up to USD 35.5 million (the  &quot;Loan&quot;) in favour of Oasis-33 Mixed Use Development Company (&quot;Oasis-33&quot; or the  &quot;Company&quot;). The Loan will be a part of a multi-bank facility that will be used  to build upon the Bank&apos;s initial transaction with the Company and support the  continued development of Ayla Marina Village and the recovery of tourism  activities in Aqaba.  The Loan will be used to (i) extend the Company&apos;s existing debt maturities and  (ii) complete the construction, equipment, and putting into operations of a new  hotel in Ayla Marina Village.</narrative>
  </description>
